RFC 8259, The JavaScript Object Notation (JSON) Data Interchange Format 8259, as kept in the cosmoes.org library
================================================================================================================

This folder is a copy of RFC 8259, The JavaScript Object Notation (JSON) Data Interchange Format 8259, kept at
https://cosmoes.org/library/json/rfc/8259/, not the publisher's own page.
The publisher is IETF (RFC Editor); its own page for this text is https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8259
The files under files/ are the publisher's files as they came from https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8259.txt
on 2026-11-22T18:35:59Z (FETCHED, SHA256SUMS). Nothing in them is changed.

